    "role": "user",
    "content": "<!-- reply 2 -->\n> 2.3. Every round checks each task already marked completed and reports, by task, any finding that would invalidate it. An invalidated task is reopened, because no done state may stand while a failure is outstanding, and it stays open until a later round clears it again.\n\nAll Regressions must be called out in the review summary.\n\n<!-- reply -->\n> 3.1. Every task of the plan under review, each with a fixed number, and the requirement to return a verdict and both scores for each one.\n\nTasks that have already achieved Agree should only be validated against regression, not completely adjudicated as an incomplete task.  Reviewer should maintain a matrix of reqs per task, reqs per change being reviewed, and completed tasks that shared an in-flux requirement should receive attention for regression.  Tasks with no reqs being adjudicated for the HV should not be reviewed unless a holistic review is requested by the operator.\n\n\n"
  }
}
