2938: 
2939: - Each implementation slice stops at `Validating`; the coordinator decides completion after the independent validation agrees (handoff, "Validation and completion gate").
2940: - Every hostile validation of this plan's work is run by the reviewer the operator names, never of the requesting agent's family (P-01), passes only at accuracy and completeness of at least 98 with no FAIL or UNKNOWN (P-05), has unbounded review time (P-02), and keeps its request and response jsonl and its entire result in the session log (the operator's HV receipts rules).
2941: - The new pipeline does not validate its own plan's work until its live check has passed and the operator approves the switch (handoff: "Do not prematurely use the new HV pipeline to validate itself").
2942: - No code is written for this plan until the operator approves it; the standing code freeze applies (section 1).
